---
import MainLayout from '../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
---

<MainLayout title="Media Kit">
<div class="media-kit-wrapper" style="background-color: #1a1a1a; color: #ffffff; padding: 3rem; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; max-width: 80rem; margin: 0 auto;">
  <header style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 3rem;">
    <h1 style="color: #FFD700; font-size: 3rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; text-transform: uppercase;">Official Nugzz Crew</h1>
    <h2 style="color: #cccccc; font-weight: normal;">Gaming Tutorials, DMO Methods & Custom Tools</h2>
  </header>

  <section style="display: flex; gap: 2rem; margin-bottom: 3rem; flex-wrap: wrap;">
    <div style="flex: 1; min-width: 300px; background-color: #2a2a2a; padding: 2rem; border-radius: 8px; border-top: 4px solid #FFD700;">
      <h3 style="color: #FFD700; margin-top: 0;">About The Channel</h3>
      <p style="line-height: 1.6;">
        The Official Nugzz Crew is a premier destination for advanced GTA V and RDR2 mechanics, save editors, and DMO methods. 
        Beyond standard gameplay, the channel provides highly technical, step-by-step video tutorials complete with high-quality voiceovers and custom web tools that keep the "Fam Bam" community heavily engaged.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div style="flex: 1; min-width: 300px; background-color: #2a2a2a; padding: 2rem; border-radius: 8px; border-top: 4px solid #FFD700;">
      <h3 style="color: #FFD700; margin-top: 0;">Audience & Reach</h3>
      <ul style="line-height: 1.6; padding-left: 20px;">
        <li><strong>YouTube:</strong> 12.1K+ Subscribers / 1.4M+ Total Views</li>
        <li><strong>Content Output:</strong> 1.3K+ Videos across multiple platforms</li>
        <li><strong>Streaming:</strong> Live 3-6 hours daily, 5-6 days a week</li>
        <li><strong>Community:</strong> Active Discord Server & Custom Web Platform</li>
        <li><strong>Audience Type:</strong> Highly technical, dedicated gamers who follow step-by-step instructions with high retention rates.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section style="background-color: #2a2a2a; padding: 2rem; border-radius: 8px; margin-bottom: 3rem; border-top: 4px solid #FFD700;">
    <h3 style="color: #FFD700; margin-top: 0;">Community Tools & Engagement</h3>
    <p style="line-height: 1.6;">
      Unlike standard gaming channels, we build custom applications for our community, resulting in massive audience retention and loyalty:
    </p>
    <ul style="line-height: 1.6; padding-left: 20px;">
      <li><strong>Custom Vehicle App:</strong> Interactive UI for plate styling, crew colors, and tire designs.</li>
      <li><strong>Emblem Creator:</strong> Bespoke tools for Rockstar Social Club integration with live preview toggles.</li>
      <li><strong>Private Support Infrastructure:</strong> Direct engagement via advanced Discord ticketing and honeypot systems.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section style="text-align: center; margin-top: 2rem;">
    <h3 style="color: #FFD700;">Sponsorship Opportunities</h3>
    <p style="line-height: 1.6; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto 2rem auto;">
      Available for 60-second pre-roll/mid-roll integrations, dedicated tutorial videos, stream overlays (Twitch/Kick), and custom website banner placements.
    </p>
    <a href="mailto:YOUR_EMAIL@DOMAIN.COM" style="background-color: #FFD700; color: #000; padding: 15px 30px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold; border-radius: 5px; font-size: 1.2rem;">Contact For Rates</a>
  </section>
</div>
</MainLayout>
